@@ -0,0 +1,101 @@
+# Activities
+
+Account activity is the same stream of events shown in the HTML timeline. Clients can consume it as a flat, newest-first list.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of account activity the current user can access.
+
+The kinds of events match the HTML timeline, with two exceptions:
+
+- deprecated `card_collection_changed` events are omitted
+- `card_title_changed` events are included
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by event creator user ID(s) |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+    "action": "comment_created",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+    "description": "David commented on \"First!\"",
+    "particulars": {},
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4#comment_03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+    "eventable_type": "Comment",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+      "updated_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+      "body": {
+        "plain_text": "This looks great!",
+        "html": "<div class=\"action-text-content\">This looks great!</div>"
+      },
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      },
+      "card": {
+        "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4"
+      },
+      "reactions_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/comments/03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz/reactions",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/comments/03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      }
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+`eventable`, `board`, and `creator` use the same representations as the rest of the API. `description` is the event's plain-text description.
+
+For card events, `url` opens the card. For comment events, `url` opens the card where the comment was posted and jumps to that comment.
+
+### Particulars
+
+`particulars` exposes event-specific details. Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
+
+| Event | Particulars |
+|-------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `{ "assignee_ids": ["..."] }` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `{ "old_board": "Marketing", "new_board": "Product" }` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `{ "old_title": "Old name", "new_title": "New name" }` |
+| `card_triaged` | `{ "column": "In Progress" }` |
+| Other events | `{}` |
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ee16a06
